tinacloud-project-create(1) -- Create a project
===============================================

## DESCRIPTION

Create a new TinaCloud project.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project create`

## OPTIONS

  * `--name`:
    Project name

  * `--org-id`:
    TinaCloud organization ID

  * `--repo-url`:
    GitHub repo URL

  * `--site-url`:
    Site URL (default "http://localhost:3000")

  * `--tina-dir`:
    Path to the tina folder (default "tina")

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

  * `--no-input`:
    Fail instead of prompting for GitHub App installation.

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud project create \
		--name "My awesome site" \
		--org-id 1e1d3398-8255-4812-9f67-388993734a01 \
		--repo-url "https://github.com/<user>/<repo>" \
		--site-url "https://mysite.com"

